# Folder Structure Rules (BẮT BUỘC)

## 📂 Root Folders
- `backend/` - Backend services
  - `AI_Generation_Service/` - Node.js AI service
  - `AI_Worker_Service/` - Python FastAPI worker
  - `API_Gateway/` - API Gateway
- `web-app/` - Frontend React application
- `docs/` - Documentation
- `database/` - SQL migrations
- `docker/` - Docker configuration

## 🎨 Frontend (`web-app/`)
- `src/components/` - Shared components
- `src/app/` - Pages (app router)
- `src/hooks/` - Custom hooks
- `src/services/` - API clients, WebSocket
- `src/types/` - TypeScript types
- `src/utils/` - Helpers
- `src/styles/` - Global CSS

## 🔧 Backend Node.js (`backend/AI_Generation_Service/`)
- `src/controllers/` - Request handlers
- `src/services/` - Business logic
- `src/models/` - Data models
- `src/routes/` - Route definitions
- `src/middleware/` - Express middleware
- `src/config/` - Configuration
- `src/tests/` - Unit tests

## 🐍 Backend Python (`backend/AI_Worker_Service/`)
- `app/` - Main application
  - `api/` - Routes
  - `services/` - Business logic
  - `schemas/` - Pydantic models
  - `core/` - Config, logging
- `tests/` - Tests
- `requirements.txt`

## 🚫 CẤM
- Tạo file `.js` (chỉ `.ts`/`.tsx`/`.py`)
- Tạo thư mục ngoài cấu trúc
- File rác (draft, debug) trong code

Xem chi tiết: `@/docs/01-business/PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md`
